  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">European Investment Bank, SDG 6, multi donor Water Sector Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The multi donor Fund will support the development and im-plementation of public and private water sector investment projects in developing countries contributing to SDG#6. The Fund will mobilise and allocate appropriate investment finance, increase the success rate of investment projects, increase the investment scope and the scale of projects, extend the benefits of projects to a wider group of end beneficiaries, improve the sustainability of project investments and strengthen the water sector actors of the borrowing country. The Fund&#x2019;s activities are focused on providing technical assistance  and a wide range of EIB financing solutions (e.g. investment grants, equity, guarantees, etc). The TA aims to improve the design and related technical aspects of projects, including assessment of environmental and social impact.  By doing so it is envisaged that these projects can be better linked to investment finance of the EIB.</narrative>
  </description>
